    "detailed_description": "A scientist made a portal machine that drags people in their normal lives to another dimension. And to get through it, they must jump from high heights and challenge themselves in this crazy world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/61067b4148c87628fb80df7257d7ae8b.poster.avif?t=1651846141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/61067b4148c87628fb80df7257d7ae8b.webm?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/61067b4148c87628fb80df7257d7ae8b.mp4?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play with your friends!</h2><br>You can play with up to 4 friends via steam play together!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various levels jump from high heights to get into the final point.</h2><br>fALL in the city, near a waterfall, a beautiful farm, and more to come!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power-ups to gain an advantage over your enemies.</h2><br>Speed you up or freeze your enemies, it\u2019s your choice!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/6c46440dba9428daee2cb587472bbe39.poster.avif?t=1651846141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/6c46440dba9428daee2cb587472bbe39.webm?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/6c46440dba9428daee2cb587472bbe39.mp4?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Randomness(?)</h2>What is this??<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/9b85649fe50c5974cb3c68ef4b13c3f5.poster.avif?t=1651846141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/9b85649fe50c5974cb3c68ef4b13c3f5.webm?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/9b85649fe50c5974cb3c68ef4b13c3f5.mp4?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game modes.</h2><br>You can challenge your friends in the Classic fALL, Blackout fALL, and One fALL!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/409e0acdad6f7da24b287203c417f8ff.poster.avif?t=1651846141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/409e0acdad6f7da24b287203c417f8ff.webm?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808770/extras/409e0acdad6f7da24b287203c417f8ff.mp4?t=1651846141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You can change the appearance of your character.</h2><br>Choose the character you want to fALL with!",
